<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Car Rental Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 32px 24px; }
        .details { background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
        .details p { margin: 8px 0; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8fafc; text-align: center; padding: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Booking Confirmed!</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello, <strong>{{clientName}}</strong>!</p>
            <p>Thank you for your reservation. Your car rental has been successfully confirmed and paid.</p>
            
            <div class="details">
                <p><strong>Car:</strong> {{carBrand}} {{carModel}}</p>
                <p><strong>Rental Period:</strong> from {{startDate}} to {{endDate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Total Price:</strong> {{totalPrice}} USD</p>
                <p><strong>Pick up place:</strong> {{pickupLocation}}</p>
                <p><strong>Drop off place:</strong> {{dropoffLocation}}</p>
            </div>

            <p>Please remember to bring your driver's license and a valid ID when picking up the vehicle.</p>
            <p>If you have any questions, please contact with us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Car Rental Service. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
